1664734881798832", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620384_1664734885132165_351045105274241951_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cB15PInC8s0Q7kNvwEz9sAW&_nc_oc=AdqCzAJINpeUtwzLiaeIqCqef7MiAuNC67ZZ3WP7BeEj5XEEdTgszN0Nv52gjeV2gbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMHYqb7HtkD4fSjI5hcnAx9fVtFoe1xBFRsF9MS6-Tg7g&oe=6AC7C8AA"}, "display_name": "Devil's Roulette  -The Pit-", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhere devils congregate, and where guns, luck, mind games, and chaos reign supreme. Welcome to hell's most wanted social club.\n{4597215590501538}\n\n# Test Your Luck, Risk It All \n{942957972101851}\nDevil\u2019s Roulette -The Pit- is a thrilling VR party game for 1 to 8 players!\n\n# Freely Customize \n{1498700681601524}\nFrom luxurious skins to an arsenal of guns and trinkets! Pursue your own style.\n\n\n# Madness-Filled Stages\n{1680610156557317}\nBattle across a multitude of stunning stages, each featuring unique gimmicks.\n\n\n# Join the Discord!!\n{1321917030022011}\nCheck our Discord for the latest news, player interactions, free skin giveaways, and more!\n\nhttps://mydearest.net/DevilsRoulette-BazookaDiscord", "short_description": "Devil's Roulette -The Pit- is a thrilling VR party game for 1 to 8 players, featuring a variety of high-stakes game modes including the new mode 'Devil's Spoons', where the player who collects four matching cards gets to pull the trigger Russian Roulette, Spin the Bottle, card-based bluffing, and more. Ready to go feral?\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Bazooka Studio",